    <string name="version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="legal_full">Video Downloader is a tool for saving publicly available videos for personal, offline use.\n\n• Only download content you own, that is in the public domain, or that you have permission to download.\n• Respect copyright and each platform\'s Terms of Service.\n• The app does not bypass logins, paywalls, private accounts or DRM protection.\n• YouTube downloads are disabled in accordance with YouTube\'s Terms of Service.\n• Downloads are processed entirely on your device using the open-source yt-dlp engine; no third-party download websites are used.\n\nYou are solely responsible for how you use downloaded content.</string>

